# Local-only: absolute project config with a machine path + Decision opt-in
# (allowDataTransfer). Tracking it would leak the operator path and auto-enable
# the experiment on fresh clones. The canonical source stays in global/.
/.opencode/opencode.json
/.opencode/opencode.jsonc
# Repository-local operating notes and instructions can contain machine- and
# project-specific information. The portable examples are under examples/ and
# global/. These ignores are not encryption or a substitute for staged review.
